#: scenario:scenario_733932F8_99D6_4C79_AA66_A85288D2ABBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7df79b97dd57cdeeadc43736ec373ffe2389259ac69e5266028cced9b4c3f1e
#. default-sha256: 81f5166319197129a270a2304d203e60e4fa677ca1dffbeb58d182b5373b6683
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_733932F8_99D6_4C79_AA66_A85288D2ABBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The room with the fireplace was always kept in pristine "
"condition so they could entertain guests at any time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫暖炉映照着金碧辉煌的大厅。⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫而达官贵人的齐聚一堂，"
"⟪k:10⟫更使得这里蓬荜生辉。"

#: scenario:scenario_93990DC2_AEFA_4178_8839_92F278F31293
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eee49751c8a3ed5e4528abb90f06920bea3b6fd1d02e9a2ccb54ec35eb4ed1e7
#. default-sha256: 6cc99d76ba779596105659bd27d255d6813b2e310a98cc92a02cdf48556ee444
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_93990DC2_AEFA_4178_8839_92F278F31293"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Walls colorfully decorated with tapestries and stained-glass windows gave testament to their "
"great fortune."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫纹理精巧的壁毯，⟪k:1⟫粲然可观的墙饰，⟪k:2⟫镂金铺翠的彩绘玻璃，⟪k:3⟫都宣告着这座馆的富饶与格"
"调。"

#: scenario:scenario_C484908D_52F5_4594_95F3_954AECDEE522
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4fd91a32813e8dbebfb455d147d1887a1efc4859defa212312e013b0ffecbda3
#. default-sha256: 880324513ff69feafc9824f1db1ab3d90b21735b159f8efe00163286f55d0cb1
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C484908D_52F5_4594_95F3_954AECDEE522"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The servants’ first assignment every morning was to clean this room."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫为此，⟪k:1⟫馆内仆人一大清早的首要工作，⟪k:2⟫就是维护客厅门面，⟪k:3⟫使之一尘不染。"

#: scenario:scenario_18E382B8_1ECB_4769_8786_65433954308B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dbd11a31ef2314c14262a9d4b9fed1ddf38c76fc7316161e8e0ffe1d22650d2b
#. default-sha256: 8daaefc7f509e946b0f7c8c008a25655624f0c6210361ef9e771010cafe34b21
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_18E382B8_1ECB_4769_8786_65433954308B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pitchers, silver plates, and silverware were polished to a shine so they could be proudly "
"put to use at a moment’s notice."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫这一点，在细节上更甚——⟪k:1⟫金壶银罐、⟪k:2⟫碗碟器皿，⟪k:3⟫无不逐一被擦拭得闪闪发亮，⟪k:4⟫似乎"
"时刻恭候着宾客的到访。"

#: scenario:scenario_EB3B5C9C_0AF1_4DC4_82C6_D50D1E9A46AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3281c6ed4ab82bbf16b484bd5c0c29de5a38115f43b0496e4d82a7e3dc7a4244
#. default-sha256: ff7752aee3c7a0640c65040ced61c1f4d85ae833766bfc150567a399d7d17952
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EB3B5C9C_0AF1_4DC4_82C6_D50D1E9A46AC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And for events like their daughter’s birthday, the room served an even more important role."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫加之今日正逢千金生辰之喜，⟪k:1⟫大厅的布置更加有条不紊。"

#: scenario:scenario_D740EFB7_CD99_4401_8898_8761EF8F9271
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9dca24f08e90e9d9a90364ea0e5d4dd5d8e1edabf3144b2151253f6c91d24e9b
#. default-sha256: e4814df0414fc5ceb14b18940ba85c858a5f7042f06e6803692e57a9f7715ba1
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D740EFB7_CD99_4401_8898_8761EF8F9271"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The tables’ tops were removable, so they had ordered new tabletops with designs made "
"especially for this occasion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫最明显就是大厅中央的餐桌——为了迎合氛围，⟪k:1⟫重新定做了新的式样。"

#: scenario:scenario_B7CAB2CD_4031_4E6C_A8AF_D0F1F486DDCB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 451c8fac8e724a9d89bf578f7b6d825e958a3943ac67f60b94c7e8ea545b1f82
#. default-sha256: fd3f015b9f44f5c6c31057903d2862c15b7879a84f4f1c1c5ec58afc1be34752
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B7CAB2CD_4031_4E6C_A8AF_D0F1F486DDCB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And once the banquet had drawn to a close, tables speckled with half-empty wine glasses and "
"leftover candied fruits were moved off to the side to make room for—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫of course—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"the festivities."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫直至晚餐接近尾声，⟪k:1⟫餐桌上仅剩美酒和甜腻的水果时，⟪k:2⟫宴会的高潮才正式开始。"

#: scenario:scenario_E4783BD9_F5CF_4FB4_8F58_D3C1BFC940DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 399005b5c4d7df82bfc4945e191a41d796461e464b00c2d2ac56f910a992de55
#. default-sha256: 8eeedf41f15f5800831779e0b728793c29e16c11c2e0ba66d66b4bd90a79c567
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E4783BD9_F5CF_4FB4_8F58_D3C1BFC940DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Good evening, Lady Nellie!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫You’re looking particularly lovely "
"today."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……啊，⟪k:5⟫奈莉小姐！⟪k:6⟫您今晚格外光彩夺目……"

#: scenario:scenario_BBFA0DBB_0B1F_4D9E_B286_7E65ADF5CEB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa35fdb71e9091922e8cca3d1d8e7a316bd433a2f09e80dd82685ca4a57527a7
#. default-sha256: ccc0336212c399babfbcbb69899100d9e7af359bbe978b3d78d92d44141536ec
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BBFA0DBB_0B1F_4D9E_B286_7E65ADF5CEB8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nellie, I had these jewels cut just for you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……奈莉，⟪k:1⟫这是我特地为你准备的宝石。"

#: scenario:scenario_836794CF_AE93_4D51_A19A_80F37CC09A07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b6fdd51265e200e3cd65c3771091cb7d38cbd592a4623f4496b5c83faaa7cd5
#. default-sha256: 82bf8a1933fd828ffb9e7354a69fffb3d87804eda1636f28a67a340ce727a370
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_836794CF_AE93_4D51_A19A_80F37CC09A07"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You’ll let me have this dance, won’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫你的舞伴非我莫属吧？"

#: scenario:scenario_8C08C1EF_FE48_40AD_AF4B_91277C0864D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40f2dc69a88108f15b7e4820a72dc8bd7878e984b2b7524c1628084202d50ea8
#. default-sha256: 74a5d8e075ec0cdaac7bbb461dd2b54100210f555abcd81b28fd93a7cb9d21e5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8C08C1EF_FE48_40AD_AF4B_91277C0864D6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫............⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Haaaaaaaahh..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫…………呼，⟪k:19⟫可累死我了——"

#: scenario:scenario_1ADB677C_2191_42BE_8E2F_65AE3D6B334A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a96a8c4c5039417cdaeca24731627ae90ff3f7eef21b83f880a439163b497b20
#. default-sha256: e64a818021f5b676a5050f02112aa2b93f0e1afc6ee4846cee5bd7b8cc7c1d8c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1ADB677C_2191_42BE_8E2F_65AE3D6B334A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What’s the matter, Nellie?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You look exhausted."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫咦，⟪k:2⟫奈莉。⟪k:3⟫你怎么看上去没精打采的？"

#: scenario:scenario_25B59912_86D9_4430_A5F0_DB07F0529EDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd9d7cac8dca437a7a874e53d6c300cd3be3158e44f3677471a2868f91783871
#. default-sha256: 94b32fc5b05437493332ad79d9729d554b6c09d24457c6f12c30445047f1f841
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_25B59912_86D9_4430_A5F0_DB07F0529EDC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫These are pretty good.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Want one? ⟪k:5⟫I know you like sweets.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"They’re apples candied in rock sugar, I think."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫这个很可口呢，⟪k:3⟫要尝尝吗？⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫没想到苹果沾糖能这么香甜……⟪k:6⟫我记得你喜欢"
"甜食吧？"

#: scenario:scenario_DA8B5329_49DB_4C6C_923F_FEDFDFE8DDA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f0f93981c17ad4bcd54f506f37307352e1dc17ab5c3f6b9202999da9f87e557
#. default-sha256: 1cfa808dc8bcbaf259031f3ee33e2bdbe4a3794972a0b7579479653f40eefe43
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DA8B5329_49DB_4C6C_923F_FEDFDFE8DDA8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You disappoint me, dearest Mell."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫你真是让我哑口无言，哥哥大人……"

#: scenario:scenario_149349B0_AE96_4EFA_889E_E106147B1CB6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc67ccd454801f6ad08451d49b4f3c170db7e0015e979ea31ab02339f5c57268
#. default-sha256: 5f3cbe4dc4053d1726d9fc264b99bb5afef6c461a476915dc24ffec889d2aec9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_149349B0_AE96_4EFA_889E_E106147B1CB6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Er?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫哎？"

#: scenario:scenario_68B11AA6_DD4F_4AF3_93EE_E20CEE066B19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08cfae76cb5a4811b5e6d89b4854ae14db61a5fe7d71f0facb7880f3edcc6f94
#. default-sha256: 9df6e3779ea923da03d18d4c4c310e25b25f52b0b53206779bad03000b722368
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_68B11AA6_DD4F_4AF3_93EE_E20CEE066B19"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What do you ⟪k:2⟫think⟪k:3⟫ is the matter?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫They just keep ⟪k:6⟫coming⟪k:7⟫. "
"It never ⟪k:8⟫ends⟪k:9⟫."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「哎？」个大头鬼啦！⟪k:2⟫这群人一个接一个的，⟪k:3⟫简直没完没了……"

#: scenario:scenario_1AB4B92C_FA3A_45DE_9E53_EC773E8EE5DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83355c5fc6cb0e18da77e1c00e534376a53a06c9f1c25c09716ebb064f776266
#. default-sha256: 2f19fe8d6b2efba753bf9422444410c09c9daa5de7656ac9a212135e0684bc90
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1AB4B92C_FA3A_45DE_9E53_EC773E8EE5DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It’s driving me up the wall.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Everyone’s just repeating the same lines they’ve "
"been taught.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫They all think pretty jewels and requests to dance are enough to make a "
"girl swoon."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫翻来覆去就那么几句漂亮话，⟪k:2⟫真是受够了！⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫这些男人是不是以为，⟪k:5⟫只要有漂亮"
"的珠宝和甜言蜜语，⟪k:6⟫全世界的女人都会为之倾倒？"

#: scenario:scenario_C20CD433_B0CD_417B_B181_C24666F35234
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a46f05614905cfc692fd31a6a9163ed61b188e94b16c3ae27553153896b6872f
#. default-sha256: e1abc70e4840199a382c0937941d922fe636e28797e4b30d67088fd81b9a2308
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C20CD433_B0CD_417B_B181_C24666F35234"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(But I think that ⟪k:2⟫is⟪k:3⟫ true for you, Nellie.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫（说实话，⟪k:2⟫我以为奈莉会喜欢这一套……）"

#: scenario:scenario_BA226F13_9347_408F_AC5B_C26B4A5BDFB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 337df1f3b84957c200fcb022b9d7e056f93f743101e3085d518154217b0d9cb5
#. default-sha256: 609c364c595641a76c40d986e8c6addbe86e701558f64947b25a27775acd79b3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BA226F13_9347_408F_AC5B_C26B4A5BDFB0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Though... ⟪k:2⟫why is she disappointed with me?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫（说起来……⟪k:2⟫为什么她说我让她哑口无言了？）"

#: scenario:scenario_4E973416_1EE7_46FA_86CD_CB839058D2EE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef03275141a505adcea181d082be73c724013218ec4ed4aa23ee0fa54d1a2b09
#. default-sha256: 12c83b7bea77dc2ceb46f46828135d6c39554b3bfc48afcbcd38e446262af4a3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4E973416_1EE7_46FA_86CD_CB839058D2EE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Uggggh, I think I’m done with birthday parties after this year."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫真讨厌，⟪k:2⟫这种生日宴明年还是别办了。"

#: scenario:scenario_F4C7CEBA_FFC0_4989_80F1_0B18359A4581
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 744d34d956c93e72c06d3ab84cc00f6f997372213f1bed36bf17482aedc378fb
#. default-sha256: 6c7f6ec115a22c6e517cc05a4d4a047f239f2c868b41e7fc63557cf1f0a605de
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F4C7CEBA_FFC0_4989_80F1_0B18359A4581"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫They’ll probably throw an even bigger one next year."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫哈哈……⟪k:2⟫我倒觉得明年会变本加厉。"

#: scenario:scenario_CD0AD072_93C9_4C07_88DF_F34C115B1CF6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b5b360c4c99bc893ae86a9237999d1b0ee42d0e6564f9206a5f9f4cb19f927b
#. default-sha256: 376bdb67f4a868230192f4196bc190fe349e222af5059dd32e99045397b92f45
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CD0AD072_93C9_4C07_88DF_F34C115B1CF6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Huh? ⟪k:2⟫Why?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫哎，⟪k:2⟫为什么！？"

#: scenario:scenario_DCB893DC_6670_47A0_BD44_6606BE247DA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed72f2ac8a8c0e4143ad3649910bf74f12e632b534380245371267ebced8a3ee
#. default-sha256: 002545e8d317cfe2f034a998b497ff0e4e7f7cb853c90ac777311da4ff453195
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DCB893DC_6670_47A0_BD44_6606BE247DA5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, you know.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You’re... ⟪k:4⟫about that age, Nellie."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫这个……⟪k:2⟫你看，⟪k:3⟫奈莉也差不多到了谈婚论嫁的年龄了。"

#: scenario:scenario_58E28F15_FFFB_40BB_8FD0_F0A7225EED44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b79d43860a49f3681a7c7f185a8083b7b684142dd941f76bc9f0a3df6e4484ad
#. default-sha256: 1428ec0c9024d5c055957350217de52fa2debf13cc5aea42068fdf0035be8368
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_58E28F15_FFFB_40BB_8FD0_F0A7225EED44"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We ⟪k:1⟫are⟪k:2⟫ a reasonably distinguished family,⟪k:3⟫so there are a number of different "
"houses⟪k:4⟫that would like to have connections with us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫再加上我们还算显赫的家族背景，⟪k:1⟫想要攀上关系的也不在少数……"

