msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nellie’s skirt fluttered along with her as she stepped in time to the music. ⟪k:3⟫"
"She was not only a skilled singer, but a skilled dancer as well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫奈莉拉着梅尔的手，⟪k:3⟫旁若无人地跟着悠扬的音乐踏出舞步，⟪k:4⟫身上艳丽的衣裙也为之"
"轻轻摆动。⟪k:5⟫正如她精灵般的歌喉一般，⟪k:6⟫她天生就善于舞蹈。"

#: scenario:scenario_0FE7527D_9FFD_42C4_B949_FB69FE44D819
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67a13bf4f184cd870afa5ea9cccd24a994fa2e2dc4db3f905b1cdc53b4b71071
