msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mell, on the other hand, fumbled over his own feet trying to keep up. ⟪k:1⟫One would be hard-"
"pressed to describe his dance abilities as “good,” even as flattery."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫对面这样的奈莉，⟪k:1⟫梅尔也只能任她摆布……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫至于跳舞水平……⟪k:4⟫实在是让人难以恭维。 "

#: scenario:scenario_2F0D3F6C_E102_4BAC_BC8F_248411697685
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d0cb297134436148e8d94c8e314cf237664f9c026adba424b13dd1469ce2a9e
